{"id":"724872afe5c644b4","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-typed-substitution.md","title":"类型替换引理","display":"thm-typed-substitution — 类型替换引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-typed-substitution","aliases":["56-thm-typed-substitution"],"display":"thm-typed-substitution — 类型替换引理","depends_on":["[[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]]","[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]"],"source_reference":"Local derivation from Terese (2003), Definitions 11.2.7,11.2.9, printed pp591–593","source_ocr_block":"612–614","verification_status":"local-typing-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-typed-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-typed-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-typed-substitution — 类型替换引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"884fb16496d08ed1\" href=\"?note=884fb16496d08ed1\" title=\"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus\">56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"96add5833bb7dcac\" href=\"?note=96add5833bb7dcac\" title=\"56-df-lambda-substitution\">56-df-lambda-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Local derivation from Terese (2003), Definitions 11.2.7,11.2.9, printed pp591–593"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"612–614"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-typing-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用简单类型语法与环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_A\\setminus\\mathrm{dom}(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\in V_A\\setminus\\mathrm{dom}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 为原始 λ 项，替换按同类型变量改名避免捕获。假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\cup\\{(x,A)\\}\\vdash M:B\">\\(\\Gamma\\cup\\{(x,A)\\}\\vdash M:B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash N:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash N:A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash M[x:=N]:B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash M[x:=N]:B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依据原书 Definitions 11.2.7、11.2.9（印刷 pp591–593，OCR 页块612–614）的本地引理。按 M 的类型推导归纳：变量 x 分支使用 N 的类型，其余变量及常元保持原类型；应用分支逐参数使用归纳假设；抽象分支先同类型新鲜改名再对体归纳。本节点不伪称原书有同号独立命题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"884fb16496d08ed1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-simply-typed-lambda-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"96add5833bb7dcac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-substitution]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\mathrm{Env}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_A\\setminus\\mathrm{dom}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\cup\\{(x,A)\\}\\vdash M:B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash N:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash M[x:=N]:B.","display":true}],"bytes":1214,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-298","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-typed-substitution.md]]"},{"id":"dfc4da988d3b91c0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$、$M\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A$；$M,N$ 为同一变量、常元签名上的原始项，$m,n\\in\\Lambda(V,F,E_\\tau)$。类型语法与无捕获替换见 [[56-thm-typed-substitution]]，$E_\\tau$ 只允许同类型变量改名。$\\to_\\beta$、$\\to_\\eta$ 对原始项取原始关系，对商元素取 [[56-df-beta-reduction]] 的代表元存在式所定义的商关系。"}],"outgoing":["884fb16496d08ed1","96add5833bb7dcac"]}